cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below, and cite the original sources listed in the README."
title: "Oil market dataset: monthly real oil price, world oil production, global crude inventories, global activity, geopolitical risk and energy transportation uncertainty, 1974m1–2026m10"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: "Morão"
    given-names: "Hugo"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-09"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/hmorao95/oil_market_dataset"
url: "https://github.com/hmorao95/oil_market_dataset"
abstract: >-
  Eight monthly series for oil market VARs, from January 1974: the real
  refiners' acquisition cost of imported crude oil, world crude oil
  production growth, the change in global crude oil inventories (Kilian and
  Murphy 2014), the world economic conditions indicator of Baumeister,
  Korobilis and Lee (2022), Kilian's (2009) index of global real economic
  activity, OECD+6 industrial production (Baumeister and Hamilton 2019), the
  historical geopolitical risk index of Caldara and Iacoviello (2022), and the
  energy transportation uncertainty index of Morão (2025). Built from public
  EIA, BLS, Baumeister, Dallas Fed, Caldara-Iacoviello and ETU data, with the Python code used to download and build it.
keywords:
  - oil market
  - crude oil
  - inventories
  - structural VAR
  - EIA
  - time series
